22	Lidar Team Geo Spatial Services	gallery/Diracai_office_Image.png	The Lidar Team Geo Spatial Services workspace focuses on advanced geospatial analysis, LiDAR data processing, and spatial intelligence solutions. The team operates in a collaborative office environment where specialists work with high-resolution mapping tools, satellite imagery, and 3D terrain visualization systems to deliver precise geographic insights.\r\n\r\nThis office supports projects involving urban planning, environmental monitoring, infrastructure mapping, and data-driven decision making. Equipped with modern computing setups and GIS software, the team transforms raw spatial data into actionable analytics for businesses and public sector initiatives.\r\n\r\nThe workspace reflects a professional and technology-driven culture, encouraging innovation, accuracy, and seamless collaboration across geospatial engineering and analytics teams.	2026-02-26 11:03:31.780989+00	office
