1	DashoApp - A Learning Platform	A comprehensive mobile application for educational institutions to manage students, courses, and resources.	D	products/covers/DashoApp.png	A comprehensive mobile application for educational institutions to manage students, courses, and resources.	DashoApp is a comprehensive mobile application designed specifically for educational institutions to streamline administrative tasks, enhance communication, and improve the overall learning experience. The app provides a unified platform for students, teachers, and administrators to access course materials, track attendance, submit assignments, view grades, and communicate effectively. The application features a modular architecture that allows educational institutions to customize the platform according to their specific needs. Key modules include student management, course management, attendance tracking, assignment submission and grading, communication tools, and analytics dashboards. We developed DashoApp using React Native for cross-platform compatibility, ensuring a consistent user experience across iOS and Android devices. The backend is powered by Node.js and MongoDB, providing a scalable and flexible foundation for the application. Firebase was integrated for real-time data synchronization, push notifications, and authentication.	education	Live	["It provides a comprehensive solution for educational institutions to manage their entire operations from student enrollment to assessment and beyond."]	["50% reduction in administrative workload for educational institutions.", "Improved communication between students, teachers, and administrators.", "Enhanced accessibility to educational resources and materials.", "Positive feedback from users, with a 4.8/5 rating on app stores.", "Successful deployment across 50+ educational institutions."]	["Creating a unified platform for diverse educational workflows.", "Ensuring real-time data synchronization across devices.", "Implementing robust security for sensitive educational data.", "Designing an intuitive interface for users of all technical abilities.", "Optimizing performance for areas with limited connectivity."]	["React Native", "Firebase", "Node.js", "MongoDB", "Redux", "Jest"]	[{"label": "Active Users", "value": "10K+"}, {"label": "Rating", "value": "4.8"}, {"label": "Downloads", "value": "50K+"}]	[]	[]	[]	https://dashoapp.com	https://dashoapp.com		t	4	2025-12-29 05:57:31.562047+00	2026-07-01 06:20:58.820922+00	₹100 per user per year	f
4	IntelliSchedule - AI Powered Timetable System	“Smart Timetables. Seamlessly Generated.” “Intelligent Scheduling for Modern Institutions.”One Platform. Perfect Timetables.”	I	products/covers/IntelliSchedule.jpg	An AI-powered timetable management system that uses Genetic Algorithms to automatically generate conflict-free schedules for institutes with multiple branches, batches, and teachers.	This timetable application is an advanced, AI-driven scheduling platform designed for large educational institutes and multi-branch organizations. It simplifies the complex process of timetable creation by combining intelligent automation with complete administrative control.\r\n\r\nThe platform supports a hierarchical admin structure where a central head-office admin can assign branch-level admins. Each branch admin manages their own institute data, including batches, teachers, subjects, and credentials.\r\n\r\nAdmins can create timetables by defining the duration (such as 30 days), daily time slots, and assigning batches and teachers. The system allows setting minimum and maximum class limits per day and per week, ensuring fair workload distribution. Teacher availability can be configured for specific days and slots, preventing scheduling conflicts.\r\n\r\nThe application also supports fixed periods, exams, and free slots, enabling admins to lock certain classes or reserve time where required. Before generating the timetable, a feasibility test runs to verify whether the inputs can produce a valid schedule. If any conflicts or constraints exist, the system highlights them and guides the admin to resolve the issues.\r\n\r\nOnce feasibility is confirmed, a Genetic Algorithm automatically generates an optimized timetable for the selected duration. Timetables are created for all batches and teachers, as well as individual batch-wise and teacher-wise views. Admins can print timetables or share them instantly via email and WhatsApp.\r\n\r\nThe platform also allows partial timetable 